<view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">LAB REPORTS</view><view class="title">保存原始化验单</view><view class="subtitle">AI可做结构化整理和趋势提示；OCR结果必须保留原图，并标记是否经过医生核对。</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice">{{error}}</view><button class="primary upload" loading="{{uploading}}" bindtap="choose">拍照或从相册选择</button><view class="section-title">历史报告</view><view wx:if="{{reports.length}}"><view wx:for="{{reports}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><view class="row"><view class="list-title">{{item.report_type}}</view><view class="pill">{{item.ocr_status}}</view></view><view class="meta">{{item.collected_at_label}} · {{item.verified_label}}</view></view></view><view wx:else class="card empty">还没有上传报告。</view><view class="bottom-note">报告识别不是诊断；异常值与分期应由兽医结合水合状态和临床资料确认。</view></view>
